{"id":"wb-6-271","name":"南汉二陵","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"南汉二陵博物馆","text":"南汉二陵博物馆位于中华人民共和国广东省广州市番禺区小谷围街道大学城华师一路8号，是广州市人民政府依托五代十国时期南汉国两位国君的陵墓——南汉二陵建立的遗址类专题博物馆。广州市文化广电旅游局下属的广州市文物考古研究院加挂南汉二陵博物馆和海上丝绸之路（广州）文化遗产保护管理研究中心的牌子，进行日常管理。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%97%E6%B1%89%E4%BA%8C%E9%99%B5%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A6%86","revisionId":95379132,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95379132","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d562ef8508631aa81642e2b8.jpg","title":"Southern_Han_Mausoleums_Museum_20220604-A.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Southern_Han_Mausoleums_Museum_20220604-A.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/Southern_Han_Mausoleums_Museum_20220604-A.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Jasonjiang.1998","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​南汉二陵博物馆","width":320,"height":240}}